WEBVTT

00:00:05.945 --> 00:00:10.204
Health → Recovery: HRV, resting heart rate and your check-ins over time.

00:00:10.254 --> 00:00:13.453
Pick a longer period to see trends.

00:00:13.503 --> 00:00:16.675
Sleep: duration, score, stages and bedtimes per night.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:22.786
Under Sleep check: the nights whose measurement may be off, with the reason. They don't count for your averages.

00:00:22.836 --> 00:00:30.078
Body: weight and other measurements, for example from a Withings scale.
